msgstr "Sistemụ Azụ Maka Ajụjụ Na-agba Otu Oge"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Họrọ otu a ga-esi rụọ ajụjụ FlowView yiri onwe ha. Legacy PHP Runner na-ekewa usoro flowview_runner.php maka ajụjụ na shard nke ọ bụla. FlowView Query Service na-eziga otu ọrụ map-reduce ahụ na ọrụ Go na-agba ogologo oge na localhost, na-ezere igbu oge mmalite usoro na nchịkọta nchekwa data maka ajụjụ nke ọ bụla. Chọrọ ka etinye ma na-agba ọrụ flowview-query (lee plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Ngwa PHP Ochie"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "Ọrụ Ajụjụ FlowView"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "URL Ọrụ Ajụjụ"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "URL Ntọala nke Ọrụ Ajụjụ FlowView, dịka ọmụmaatụ http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Hapụ ya n'efu ka ọ chọpụta ọdụ ụgbọ nwa oge na-akpaghị aka site na faịlụ ọdụ ụgbọ nke ọrụ ahụ."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Faịlụ Pọtụ Ọrụ Ajụjụ"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Ụzọ ebe faịlụ ọdụ njikọ dị nke FlowView Query Service na-ede adreesị ya ejikọtara.  A na-eji ya chọpụta njedebe ọrụ mgbe Query Service URL dị n'elu tọgbọ chakoo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Token Ọrụ Ajụjụ"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Ihe nzuzo ekekọrịtara nhọrọ.  Mgbe edobere ya, Cacti na-eziga ya na FlowView Query Service dịka isiokwu \"Authorization: Bearer\" ma ọrụ ahụ na-ajụ arịrịọ ọ bụla na-agbanwe ọnọdụ nke na-egosighi otu token ahụ.  Tọọ uru dakọtara na faịlụ nhazi ọrụ ahụ (auth_token) ma ọ bụ mgbanwe gburugburu FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN.  A na-atụ aro ya mgbe ọ bụla ihe ọ bụla ọzọ na-abụghị usoro mpaghara ntụkwasị obi nwere ike iru ọrụ ahụ."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Eriri Ọrụ Otu Oge Kacha Elu"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ kachasị elu nke eriri a ga-ezipụ iji mee ajụjụ FlowView.  Rịba ama na ị nwere ike ịnwe naanị 1 eriri maka nkewa nchekwa data ọ bụla, ma ị kwesịrị ịkpachara anya ka ị ghara ibufe sava nchekwa data gị ibu karịa site n'inwe ọtụtụ eriri na-agba n'otu oge."

#: setup.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Gbanyụrụ"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Threads"
msgstr "Thread %d"

#: setup.php
msgid "Maximum Run Time"
msgstr "Oge Ọrụ Kacha Elu"

#: setup.php
msgid "If the Parallel Query does not finish in this time, exit."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na Ajụjụ Yiri Onwe ya agwụghị n'ime oge a, pụọ."

#: setup.php
msgid "Cached Data Time to Live"
msgstr "Oge Ndụ Data Echekwara na Cache"

#: setup.php
msgid "How long should FlowView hold onto Cached Query results before purging them?"
msgstr "Ogologo oge ole ka FlowView ga-ejide nsonaazụ Ajụjụ echekwara tupu ya ehichapụ ha?"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Hours"
msgstr "Elekere %d"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Ụbọchị %d"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Ụbọchị %d"

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Sharding"
msgstr "Nkebi MaxScale"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is only required if your Cacti System's Flowview Database connection is not already using a MaxScale enabled Read-Write Split port."
msgstr "A chọrọ nke a naanị ma ọ bụrụ na njikọ Nchekwa Data Flowview nke Sistemụ Cacti gị anaghị eji ọdụ ụgbọ mmiri Read-Write Split nke MaxScale gbanyere ugbua."

#: setup.php
msgid "Leverage MaxScale to Distribute Query Shards"
msgstr "Jiri MaxScale Kesaa Query Shards"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you have multiple service acting as slaves for MaxScale, you can increase the speed of querying by distributing the parallel queries to multiple MariaDB backend servers."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ị nwere ọtụtụ ọrụ na-arụ ọrụ dị ka ohu maka MaxScale, ị nwere ike ịbawanye ọsọ nke ajụjụ site n'ikesa ajụjụ ndị yiri onwe ha n'ọtụtụ sava azụ MariaDB."

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Read-Write Split Port"
msgstr "Pọtụ Nkewa Ọgụgụ-Odide MaxScale"

#: setup.php
msgid "This should be the port of the Read-Write-Split-Service (readwrite) service and router."
msgstr "Nke a kwesịrị ịbụ pọtụ nke ọrụ na rọta Read-Write-Split-Service (readwrite)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Flowview"
msgstr "Flowview"

